{title: Thuli Thuli Mazhaiyaa}
{artist: Yuvan Shankar Raja}
{key: Gm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Gm] [Eb] [F],        Thuli thuli thuli mazhaiyai vanthale..ey
[Gm] [Eb] [F],        Suda suda suda marainthey ponaale.....ey
[Gm] [F],        Paarthal paarka thondrum
[Eb] [F],        Perai ketka thondrum
[Gm],        Poo pol sirikum podhu
[Eb] [F],        Kaatrai paranthida thondrum
[Gm] [Bb],        Sel sel avalidam sel
[Eb] [F],        Endrey kaalgal solluthada
[Cm] [Bb] [Dm] [F],        Azhagai manathai parithu vittaley
[Gm],        Devathai aval oru devathai
[Gm] [Dm],        Azhagiya poo mugam kaanavey
[Eb] [F],        Aayul thaan podhumo
(same as above),        Kaatriley avaladhu vaasanai
Avalidam yosanai kettuthaan,        Pookalum pookumo
[Gm],        Netri meley ottrai mudi aadum bothu
[Gm],        Nenjukkulley minnal pookum
[F] [Eb] [Dm],        paarvai aalai thookum
(Same as above),        Kannam paarthaal muthangalal
theendazh thondrum,        Paatham rendum paarkum bothu
golusaai maara thondrum,        [Cm] [Bb] [Dm] [F]
Azhagai manathai parithu vittaley
